:: Outside [nobr]
<<CurrentObjective>>
<<HUD>>

<<if not $leftApartmentOnce>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>I lock the door behind me. The hallway smells like someone else&apos;s breakfast. Something good. Something real. My stomach tightens, whether or not I&apos;ve eaten.</p>
</div>
<<set $leftApartmentOnce to true>>
<</if>>

<<if $novaCureDay1Done and not $seenWalkHomeD1>>
<<ImagePlaceholder "Walking home past a bar, a whistle, a hand around her keys" "banner" "assets/characters/mc-female-phase1/walk-home-whistle.png">>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>The walk home from the bus stop takes seven minutes. It used to take five. Shorter legs. Shorter stride. My hips sway with each step   I&apos;m not doing it on purpose. It&apos;s how this skeleton moves.</p>
<p>I pass a group of men outside a bar. Four of them. Beers in hand. I don&apos;t look at them. I look at the sidewalk. My hood is up. My hands are in my pockets.</p>
<p>A whistle. Sharp, two-toned, the universal sound of a man reducing a woman to her outline.</p>
<p>I walk faster. My heart hammers. My keys are in my pocket   I pull them out, hold one between my fingers, a weapon I didn&apos;t know I&apos;d need until this exact second. This is what women do. This is what women have always done. I never thought about it. Not once. Not in twenty years of being the species that whistles.</p>
</div>
<<set $seenWalkHomeD1 to true>>
<</if>>

<<ObjectiveBanner>>

